    mercury:['水星是离太阳最近的行星，从地球看往往离太阳不远。全天球图展示它的方向，不判断当地是否适合观测。','Mercury is the closest planet to the Sun and stays near it in Earth’s sky. The atlas plots its direction, rather than predicting local observing conditions.'],
    polaris:['北极星靠近北天极，能指引北方。它并非夜空最亮的恒星，却因这个特殊的位置，成为远行者熟悉的坐标。','Polaris lies close to the north celestial pole. It is not the brightest star, but its position has made it a familiar guide to north.'],
