    vega:['织女星位于天琴座，与牛郎星、天津四共同构成夏季大三角。传统故事里的两岸，在这里成为可以慢慢寻找的天空坐标。','Vega in Lyra forms the Summer Triangle with Altair and Deneb. These three bright stars offer an easy route across the northern summer sky.'],
    altair:['牛郎星位于天鹰座，是夏季大三角的顶点之一。与织女星遥遥相望，两颗亮星也是中国星空故事中熟悉的一幕。','Altair in Aquila is one corner of the Summer Triangle. In Chinese sky traditions it is the Cowherd, paired with Vega across the Milky Way.'],
    deneb:['天津四位于天鹅座尾部，是夏季大三角中的一颗亮星。沿着天鹅座的十字形连线，可以顺势寻访银河。','Deneb marks the tail of Cygnus and a corner of the Summer Triangle. The Northern Cross traces the Swan along the Milky Way.'],
    betelgeuse:['参宿四是猎户座肩部的红超巨星。它偏暖的颜色，与猎户座足部蓝白色的参宿七形成鲜明对照。','Betelgeuse is the red supergiant at Orion’s shoulder. Its warm colour contrasts with blue-white Rigel at the Hunter’s foot.'],
